{
  "_about": "Components of the compiler (dev-docs/measurements/selfhost-port-map.md §7.1): stage0 files under compiler/src, port files under selfhost/, and the pin of ADR-0113. Edited by scripts/components.py (pin, repin) and by hand (files, ledger).",
